#: src/fallback-to-parent-justfiles.md:1
msgid "Fallback to parent `justfile`s"
msgstr ""

#: src/fallback-to-parent-justfiles.md:3
msgid ""
"If a recipe is not found in a `justfile` and the `fallback` setting is set, "
"`just` will look for `justfile`s in the parent directory and up, until it "
"reaches the root directory. `just` will stop after it reaches a `justfile` "
"in which the `fallback` setting is `false` or unset."
msgstr ""

